<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Response Generation Prompt</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To guide model responses grounded in tabular data, we employed a standardized prompt that specifies the assistant’s role, objective, and the required response length and format. The full prompt is shown in Prompt <a href="#A3.SS2" title="C.2 Response Generation Prompt ‣ Appendix C LLM Prompts ‣ Query-Centric Graph Retrieval Augmented Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="53.95" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 53.95" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,53.95) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 50.49 C 0 52.4 1.55 53.95 3.46 53.95 L 546.54 53.95 C 548.45 53.95 550 52.4 550 50.49 L 550 3.46 C 550 1.55 548.45 0 546.54 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 32.4 L 549.31 32.4 L 549.31 3.46 C 549.31 1.93 548.07 0.69 546.54 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.16 39.72)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.29em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="460.64"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.SS2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.29em;">
