<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>A Case Study on MultiHop-RAG</h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present an example of question answering with supporting evidence chunks on MultiHop-RAG in Example <a href="#A4.SS2" title="D.2 A Case Study on MultiHop-RAG ‣ Appendix D Case Studies ‣ Query-Centric Graph Retrieval Augmented Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D.2</span></a>. The example question is of the type “comparison query,” which requires leveraging two long documents, “<span id="A4.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">doc-451</span>” and “<span id="A4.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">doc-167</span>,” to answer. Each document can be segmented into multiple chunks, with each chunk containing no more than 1200 tokens.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.SS2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="55.03" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 55.03" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,55.03) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 51.57 C 0 53.48 1.55 55.03 3.46 55.03 L 546.54 55.03 C 548.45 55.03 550 53.48 550 51.57 L 550 3.46 C 550 1.55 548.45 0 546.54 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#ECECEC;" fill="#ECECEC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 33.47 L 549.31 33.47 L 549.31 3.46 C 549.31 1.93 548.07 0.69 546.54 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.16 40.79)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.29em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="460.64"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.SS2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.29em;">
<span id="A4.SS2.p2.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_indent">
<span id="A4.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example D.2: </span><span id="A4.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">An example of question answering on Multihop-RAG</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.16 13.62)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.28em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="529.69"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.SS2.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:38.28em;">
<span id="A4.SS2.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
